Suggests: modloader
Description: Kernel based root solution for Android (DKMS module)
 KernelSU implements a root solution in kernel space. This package ships the
 kernel module sources from the waydroid-experimental fork as a DKMS tree,
 intended for container based solutions such as Waydroid on regular Linux
 kernels.
 .
 Besides the DKMS module it installs the ksuinit binary as
 /usr/bin/kernelsu-loader, a modprobe.d alias and the load-kernelsu helper
 script (used together with the modloader utility).
